Level Result <code>default</code> Normal portal behavior, including restore tokens <code>ask</code> Require consent or selection every time <code>allow</code> Approve the rule's specified capabilities <code>deny</code> Reject without a dialog <p>The global default accepts <code>default</code>, <code>ask</code> or <code>deny</code>. Automatic approval needs an explicit app rule. To ask every time by default:</p> <pre><code>gnoblin.configure {
    permissions = {default = "ask"},
}
</code></pre> <p>Add this to <code>~/.config/gnoblin/init.lua</code>. Individual rules can override it.</p> <p>A matching deny always wins. Otherwise the last matching rule wins as a whole; device and monitor lists do not merge across rules.</p>
